# The constellation rehearsal's wire pen, seated 20260828.011621. comlink/rehearsal_wire.rye
# crosses three real processes over localhost UDP and was reached by no runner, roster, or suite
# until this guard -- it ran when a hand typed its name and at no other time. It is the pen FORA31,
# the socket rung where constel/ meets comlink/hosted_wire.rye, is to be proven in, so the pen
# earns a standing guard before the rung lands in it. `cadence` rather than `lap`: three spawned
# processes binding real ports is the thin edge, and the thin edge is budgeted rather than free.
# Measured on this bench 20260828: 2-3s with a warm Zig cache, build included.

guard comlink_rehearsal_wire
